<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Niagara Mohawk Power Corp, Western Digital Corp, and AMP Inc were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Fruehauf Trailer Corp and Corimon SACA were also unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
